part lis
  tally 1
  note "Copy for the family reality E1 (tmp/cases/tally-1.0.1/households/E1, O:E1-1): L §6.1 allows one model header, so this header is a part header and on/start/end are the family's (households/E1/family.tally); nothing renamed."
  note "Household A, the Lis family of Dębowo (tmp/cases/A/story.md): Ania (Anna) and Tomek (Tomasz), married 2016-09-10 without a marriage contract, and Zosia (Zofia), born 2023-04-27. Amounts are in DUK, the dukat of Lenia, of 100 orts."
  note "The reality is this directory and the law parts in tmp/cases/tally-1.0.1/law/ it reads: GEN-1, GEN-6, PIT-2 to PIT-9, SOC-1, SOC-2, SOC-8, FAM-1, WCP-1, WCP-2, CIV-1, IGT-2 to IGT-4, CC-1, CC-2, MOT-1, MOT-2."
  note "Record files (tmp/cases/A/records/) are not imported: the importer's dialect isn't specified (observation O:A-1), so records.tally holds only the few rows the questions read, each citing its file and line, and the closing balances as stated anchors."

